{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1473037-charlie-brown-in-the-cod","id":1473037,"title":"Charlie Brown in the CoD","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-01-22T11:49:08-08:00","id":1473037,"title":"Charlie Brown in the CoD","content":"Well by now you should all expect me to be posting weird left field stuff .. here's what I came up with while bored at work on Friday.<br /> <br /> Its not complete of course, just brain storming ideas and such.<br /> <br /> Charlie Brown \u2013 Charlie suffered a horrible tragedy at 15, when Snoopy, his beloved dog, died of old age. Unable to cope with loss of what was really his only friend besides Linus van Pelt, Charlie suffered a breakdown and would have gone completely off the rails if Snoopy hadn\u2019t returned to him as a ghost, along with a small yellow bird, Woodstock. His beloved pet back, Charlie regained himself and managed to finish and graduate highschool, then went to university to study the paranormal. He graduated with a degree in ancient cultures and history and a minor in archaeology. He spent his middle and late 20s hunting for legends, myths and other things that shouldn\u2019t exist, aided by Linus. When he turned 30 he got an inheritance from his grandparents that allowed his to open a PI business that specialized in the weird, the occult, the supernatural. He was a ghost hunter now. The little red-hair girl also grew up and Charlie ran into her just in his early 30s and the two started dating and are now engaged. She seems to encourage his pursuits, having even come with him on several outings.<br /> <br /> Sally Brown-Carmichael \u2013 Sally grew up into a beautiful blonde, top of her class, cheerleader, prom queen and then graduated top of her class in business management. She went to work at a prominent business and within three years was married to one of the senior partners. Living in splendour and comfort, her days spent playing tennis, working out, shopping and generally just doing what ever she wanted, she became a contented trophy wife to Simon Carmichael. Sally is a silent partner in her brother\u2019s business, helping him with money and a rent free office. On the surface she does this as an act of sisterly love, helping her silly big brother, but in reality she has been in a secret affair with Linus for close to five years and its to make sure he has money, a job and a place to live that she really helps out, not that she would admit it. She occasionally joins them on outings.<br /> <br /> Snoopy \u2013 Snoopy, the beloved beagle died at the age of 18 in the arms of his owner. For some reason he realized how much hurt and sorry his owner was in, and returned to him as a ephemeral being to be at his side for all time. Snoopy can be seen by Charlie, and anyone else with the ability to see ghosts, and is very protective of his owner. He has some ability to interact with the material world, a bit of TK and a bit of sound making. Mostly he just warns Charlie of danger and helps him find stuff.<br /> <br /> Woodstock \u2013 This little yellow bird was Snoopy\u2019s constant companion and when he died he also return, to be with his friend. When Snoopy died the two were together in the ephemeral, and when Snoopy came back, so did Woodstock. Charlie can see Woodstock but really isn\u2019t sure what to make of him, as he\u2019s technically a ghost attached to another ghost.<br /> <br /> Lucy van Pelt \u2013 Lucy grew up into a very serious and no-nonsense woman, and became a noted psychologist and therapist. Her career dominating her life she had little time for anything else till she chanced on Beethoven\u2019s, a piano lounge bar owned by her old crush Schroeder. She walked in an saw him playing on a baby grand and suddenly she was in love all over again. Of course Schroeder rebuffed her, still committed to being a life long bachelor like his hero. Still, Lucy comes to the bar each time, and sits at the piano, drinking a glass of wine and listening to the music. She still makes sly innuendos to him, implying she\u2019d like nothing better than for him to take her upstairs and play her like his does his piano. She\u2019s not impressed that it seems all her old school mates hang out at the bar and does he best to keep away from them, but has lately seemed to fallen back into the habit of occasionally sitting and talking with Frieda (whom she hates due her looks) and Violet (whom she hates cause it seems she is also interested in Schroeder).<br /> <br /> Linus \u2013 Linus grew up tall, handsome, and athletic. He was a top basketball player, known as the \u201cBlanket Man\u201d because of his lucky blanket he still owned. All threw high school he, Charlie and Schroeder were the intrepid trio, always hanging out together and always sticking up for each other. At university he was int he same classes as Charlie and when two graduated they teamed up to explore the world\u2019s mysteries. When Charlie opened his business, he was right there as a partner and fellow ghost hunter. A consummate bachelor, he is generally the center of attention for women, but he only has eyes for Sally, whom he has been having an secret affair with for over five years. Oh, he still has his blanket, an item so infused with his love and memories that is has become a relic, capable of provided protection and even healing properties when he sleeps with it.<br /> <br /> Frieda \u2013 The gal so proud of her red hair grew up to become a aerobics/yoga/gym instructor and personal trainer. She has graced the covers of several issues of local men\u2019s magazines and health magazines and considered one of the more attractive women in the city, and is generally the object of many men and women\u2019s desire. When not working she hangs at Schroeder\u2019s bar with her old school friend Violet.<br /> <br /> Violet \u2013 As someone who enjoyed the rules, Violet grew up to become one of the city\u2019s better lawyers, a partner at one of the more prestigious firms. She works hard and when done, goes to Beethoven\u2019s drinks and moons over Schroeder while hanging out with Frieda. The two are still friends and do a lot together. She is not too keen on Lucy having rejoined their circle, especially considering her history with Schroeder.<br /> <br /> Schroeder \u2013 plays piano at a bar he owns in the downtown, a high end club frequented by many of the city's rich, famous and infamous.<br /> <br /> Pigpen \u2013 Biochemist, hangs at Schroeder\u2019s bar<br /> <br /> Peppermint patty \u2013 tough gal who works a bouncer/manager at Schroeder\u2019s club<br /> Marcie \u2013 lounge singer at Schroeder\u2019s club<br /> <br /> Franklin \u2013 police officer, hangs at Schroeder\u2019s bar<br /> <br /> Little red headed girl \u2013 Charlie\u2019s girl friend and fianc\u00e9.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/722-walksforever","name":"Walksforever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar722_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}